  "Name": "Allwinner 3.4 Legacy Kernel Local Privilege Escalation",
  "Description": "This module attempts to exploit a debug backdoor privilege escalation in Allwinner SoC based devices. Vulnerable Allwinner SoC chips: H3, A83T or H8 which rely on Kernel 3.4. Vulnerable OS: all OS images available for Orange Pis, any for FriendlyARM's NanoPi M1, SinoVoip's M2+ and M3, Cuebietech's Cubietruck + Linksprite's pcDuino8 Uno. Exploitation may be possible against Dragon (x10) and Allwinner Android tablets.",
